// # Service Mesh, eBPF & Kernel Networking Facade
//
// Logline: Unified standard library facade re-exporting eBPF verifier, fast-path maps, Envoy xDS, mTLS, and overlay routing.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim importing all 49 companion submodules and exposing top-level system entry points.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import eBPF verification, kernel maps, XDP, TC, sockops, and tracing submodules.
//   2. Import Envoy xDS, mTLS SPIFFE, traffic policies, and kernel overlay network submodules.
//   3. Maintain unified standard library entry point for mesh_ebpf subsystem.

